# Mega-TU module manifest for native-compose option (A) — see
# sv0c/doc/archive/native-compose-tradeoffs.md. Paths relative to sv0c/, in pipeline order.
# Assembled by scripts/assemble-sv0-megaTU.py (./scripts/sv0 assemble-megatu).
#
# A1 status: FULL pipeline — all 18 modules assemble into one TU that compiles
# (SML -> C ~34k lines -> cc, binary runs). The assembler AUTO-NAMESPACES any name
# a module defines that an earlier module already claimed (the back-end's divergent
# core types Expr/Value/Instr/Ty become e.g. lowering_Value / codegen_Value /
# vm_codegen_Value, each with its uses rewritten self-consistently).
#
# A2 (in progress): the assembler appends sv0c/lib/megaTU-main.sv0 as the compose
# main. It currently drives the REAL lexer (tokenize) + parser (parse_program) and
# asserts a program parses; `assemble-megatu --check` compiles AND runs it. Next:
# thread resolve -> check -> lower -> emit_program over the shared arenas so the
# mega-TU emits C, validated by native-vs-SML behavioral parity.

